# Supabase Configuration
# Required for Phase 2: Backend Integration

# Instructions:
# 1. Go to https://app.supabase.com and create a project
# 2. Once ready, go to Settings → API
# 3. Copy "Project URL" below:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co

# 4. Copy "anon public" key below:
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# See PHASE2_SUPABASE_SETUP.md for complete setup guide
